Pull Request https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/70100 added following comment markers to Ports Field of type slice of ContainerPort Struct inside Container struct in core/v1/types.go

	// +listType=map
	// +listMapKey=containerPort
	// +listMapKey=protocol

kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools converts these comment markers to x-kubernetes-list-type and x-kubernetes-list-map-keys as per https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/api-concepts/#merge-strategy for Server Side Apply.

Please advice the purpose of adding listType and listMapKey comment markers to Ports Field of type slice of ContainerPort Struct inside Container struct in core/v1/types.go.

I worked around this issue by removing below comment markers from Ports Field of type slice of ContainerPort Struct inside Container struct in $GOPATH/pkg/mod/k8s.io/api@v0.18.6/core/v1/types.go

	// +listType=map
	// +listMapKey=containerPort
	// +listMapKey=protocol

Then controller-gen did not add x-kubernetes-list-type and x-kubernetes-list-map-keys to CRD
